            "title": "Economic Growth Theory: Solow-Swan & Endogenous Innovation",
            "urduTitle": "Economics مطالعہ: Economic Growth Theory: Solow-Swan & Endogenous Innovation",
            "level": "Growth Economics",
            "readTime": "9 min",
