            "title": "Pakistan Economy: Structure, IMF Programs & Structural Challenges",
            "urduTitle": "Economics مطالعہ: Pakistan Economy: Structure, IMF Programs & Structural Challenges",
            "level": "South Asian Economics",
            "readTime": "10 min",
